# Namaskaar Mitranno
# 📈 Option Trading Strategies using DHAN Trade Hull API

This repository contains a collection of algorithmic **option trading strategies** built using the **[DHAN Trade Hull API](https://trade.dhan.co/)**.  
It is designed for traders and developers who want to automate, backtest, and deploy option strategies with DHAN’s modern trading infrastructure.

---

## 🚀 Overview

The goal of this project is to provide a **modular and scalable framework** for developing and executing **options trading strategies** such as:
- ✅ Straddle / Strangle
- ✅ Iron Condor
- ✅ Bull & Bear Spreads
- ✅ Covered Call / Protective Put
- ✅ Custom Algo Strategies (user-defined logic)

These strategies are executed via the **DHAN Trade Hull API**, enabling:
- Real-time market data
- Order placement & management
- Portfolio tracking
- Risk and margin monitoring
- WebSocket streaming for live updates

---

## 🧠 Features

- 🔹 **Plug-and-play strategy modules** — easy to add or modify strategies  
- 🔹 **Live & paper trading support** using DHAN APIs  
- 🔹 **Comprehensive logging** for trade execution and error tracking  
- 🔹 **Backtesting framework** (optional) for historical performance analysis  
- 🔹 **Environment-configurable setup** for API keys and trade parameters  
- 🔹 **Real-time Greeks & P&L tracking**

---

## ⚙️ Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/dhan-options-trading.git

# Navigate to project folder
cd dhan-options-trading

# Create and activate a virtual environment (optional)
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # for Linux/Mac
venv\Scripts\activate      # for Windows

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
